## Base URL of the Express/Socket.IO backend (server/). This is the ONLY env var the
## admin dashboard needs — it is safe to expose to the browser (no secrets), which is why
## it uses the NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix. Never put DB credentials, JWT secrets, or other private
## keys in a NEXT_PUBLIC_ variable — those stay in server/.env only.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000
